1
00:00:00,498 --> 00:00:02,378
(Leonard:)...on Billy the Kid's cowboy hat?

2
00:00:02,542 --> 00:00:06,002
(Howard:)What? Please.
This is Billy the Kid we're talking about.

3
00:00:06,170 --> 00:00:08,710
(Howard:)The wizard would get shot
before he could get out the words:

4
00:00:08,881 --> 00:00:12,591
"What the hell is Billy the Kid doing
in the mystic realm of Ka'a?"

5
00:00:13,344 --> 00:00:15,344
Leonard, ahem...

6
00:00:15,513 --> 00:00:17,973
(Stuart:)...what's the deal
with Sheldon's friend Amy?

7
00:00:18,141 --> 00:00:20,431
(Stuart:)- Are they a couple?
- A couple of weirdos. Why?

8
00:00:22,311 --> 00:00:23,441
Are you interested in Amy?

9
00:00:23,604 --> 00:00:25,644
(Stuart:)Well, I mean,
she didn't look through me...

10
00:00:25,815 --> 00:00:30,565
(Stuart:)...with soul-sucking, ball-shriveling
hatred and contempt.

11
00:00:30,945 --> 00:00:32,325
(Stuart:)I like that in a woman.

12
00:00:33,781 --> 00:00:36,451
(Stuart:)Could you run it by Sheldon
if I could ask her out?

13
00:00:36,617 --> 00:00:37,997
(Leonard:)Sure, I guess.

14
00:00:38,161 --> 00:00:39,831
(Raj:)Stuart, settle an argument for us.

15
00:00:39,996 --> 00:00:42,876
(Raj:)Who would win,
Billy the Kid or the white Wizard?

16
00:00:44,292 --> 00:00:47,922
(Stuart:)If I tell you that, I'm robbing you
of the hours of fun you could have...

17
00:00:48,087 --> 00:00:53,297
(Stuart:)...for the magical, rootin'- tootin
Iow price of 24.95.

18
00:00:54,802 --> 00:00:57,302
- I'll take one.
- Mm. Make it two.

19
00:00:57,889 --> 00:00:59,969
I hate all of you and myseIf. Three.

20
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:02,980
(Stuart:)I'll ring it up.

21
00:01:03,853 --> 00:01:07,103
(Stuart:)Like shooting nerds in a barrel.

